{"id":"u-b61efdc3-88ea-4cba-989c-a96b6d23475d","src":"community","title":"5/3/1 Anchor - 5s Pro, Jokers and FSL","author":"zcd","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/Ueb3dD-531-pervertor-1","desc":"This is from page 64 of the 5/3/1 Forever book\n\nJoker sets are extra work sets added above the highest percentage set for the day.  These are usually done for 1-2 sets of 1-3 reps at 5-10% above the highest set of the day\n\n3/5/1 Programming, and joker sets are only used on the first and third weeks of the cycle, week two is all about bar speed and rep quality\n\nThe recommended periodization for 5/3/1 is to do 2 leader cycles followed by 1 anchor cycle.  A complete mesocycle would follow this format:\n\nWeeks 1-3 (Leader cycle 1) \nIncrease TMs +5lbs upper body lifts / +10lbs lower body lifts\nWeeks 4-6 (Leader cycle 2)\n7th Week deload \nIncrease TMs  +5lbs upper body lifts / +10lbs lower body lifts\nAnchor cycle","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":30,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-26T18:55:16.634Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":80}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":90}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":1,"hi":3,"pct":95}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":5}]},{"n":"Push Accessories","sets":[{"lo":50,"hi":100}]},{"n":"Pull Accessories","sets":[{"lo":50,"hi":100}]},{"n":"Single Leg / Core Accessories","sets":[{"lo":50,"hi":100}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":80}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":90}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":1,"hi":3,"pct":95}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":5}]},{"n":"Push Accessories","sets":[{"lo":50,"hi":100}]},{"n":"Pull Ac